DESCRIPTION:Do you make it to the end of the long list of changes each Djan
 go version brings? What goes through your head? Are you bored\, lost\, exc
 ited\, or confused?\n\nFor us sometimes a seemingly plain sentence would t
 rigger light bulb moments.\n\nIn this talk\, we will present hidden gems f
 rom Django >= 5.0 together with the comparison of how the code would look 
 with and without them. \n\nFind beauty in the small things. It’s the sma
 ll things that make up everything.
